<title>USA: Lehman names emerging markets executive.</title>
<headline>Lehman names emerging markets executive.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Wednesday that it has named Jose Barrionuevo as head of its Emerging Markets Group sovereign and corporate stategy and research, in an expansion of the department.</p>
<p>Barrionuevo was previously a senior vice president at Chase Manhattan Corp unit Chase Securities, where he helped develop that bank's emerging markets sovereign research activities, Lehman said.</p>
